# --- alphaGrid additions (BUILD_PROMPT.md §8.6: never stage credentials or artifacts) ---
# Merged with the pre-existing grid-trading .gitignore during the S1 upstream import.
# Local credential files (exact names ONLY — never broad globs: a *credentials* glob
# would swallow legit source files like env-credentials.ts). NEVER commit these.
